OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny evening
OL,6,Fshowers will quickly fade away,
OL,7,Fleaving a fine and dry overnight
OL,8,Fperiod with light winds. Clear spells
OL,9,Fare likely to develop, leading to a
OL,10,Frather chilly feel by Friday morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA largely fine and dry day.
OL,13,FOccasional sunny spells are likely,
OL,14,Fespecially at first, although some
OL,15,Fcloud will build through the day.
OL,16,FLight winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
